feat(catalog-product): the product domain joins — 14 RPCs with the storefront search face

The biggest catalog domain: the main table (status as the stored
PRODUCT_STATUS_* spelling, the category/brand links, the image), the
translation table (short/long descriptions), the 12 standard CRUD
RPCs, and the two anonymous search RPCs the storefront whitelist
carries — SearchProducts (an ILIKE over the requested language's
translation names joined to ACTIVE-status main rows, paged off the
request's own page/page_size with the server cap 50) and
SearchProductSuggestions (the same face capped at five). The status
enum maps both ways between the proto ProductStatus values and the
stored spellings the reference's demo data pins.

The proxy side needed nothing (Product was already grounded as pass);
the bootstrap gate grew the two product tables.

verified: admin login + product create (status/category/brand/
bilingual translation), the anonymous product-search hitting the new
row (productId/name/imageUrl carried), the suggestions face, and the
storefront detail GET answering 200
